-- הסכם קיבוצי מיום 22.5.1997 בדבר הנהגת דרגות קידום במכללות להכשרת עובדי
-- הוראה: the agreement between the State and הסתדרות המורים that brings
-- promotion ranks into the teacher-training colleges, registered on
-- 15.12.1997 (no. 434/97). Whom it covers (§2); the basic rank and the four
-- promotion ranks (§3); who may be promoted (§4); the criteria, their
-- weights and the year's timetable (§5); each rank's share of the
-- candidates (§6) and the exceptions below a 75% position (§7); the time in
-- a rank before the next (§8); the college's appointments committee (§9)
-- and the inter-college one (§10); the supplement each rank pays (§11) and
-- from when (§12); when a rank is cancelled (§13); the formation stage
-- (§14); a new teacher with an academic appointment (§15); equivalent salary
-- grades (§16); the sabbatical (§17); the accompanying committee (§18); and
-- what the agreement keeps and settles (§19). Annexed: the colleges (א'),
-- the committees' procedures (ב'), a side letter on dismissal and tenure,
-- and the summary of the pedagogic dismissal procedure.
--
-- The amendment of 30.12.1997 changes §18(א) and imports this file
-- (l4/agreements/teachers-general/1997-12-30_histadrut-hamorim_michlalot-promotion-ranks-amendment.l4).
-- An amendment of 18.12.2001 is outside the corpus. From 1.9.2018 the
-- agreement of 21.1.2019 voids the promotion grades and pays a trailing
-- supplement at the eve's rate in their place (its §5(א),
-- l4/agreements/teachers-general/2019-01-21_teachers_michlalot-reform-amendment.l4).
-- It speaks to no pay item of l4/lib/vocabulary.l4 and is in no root.
--
-- Three of its cross-references name a clause about something else
-- (§13.ג.4, §16.א, §14.יט). Each is read by the convention
-- reading.cross-reference-subject, a pick put to the lawyer (MMS-623), and
-- each is a finding (F-michlalot-1997-a, -b, -c). The corpus's own sic marks
-- (9.ד.4 for 9.ד.5, 10.ד.2 for 9.ד.2, 6.ג for 6.ה, a rank's name cut short)
-- are taken as the corpus reads them.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT womens_work_law

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘יום עבודה’ is
-- defined (annex ב', chapter ד', 6) as a day the college operates, to count
-- the election committee's deadlines; and the positions (75%, 100%, 50% in
-- the academic tracks) are conditions of a rank. Neither sets a working
-- hour, day or week, nor the pay of an hour the law counts.

-- not weighed against `the Equal Pay Law`: the words the search found are
-- not on its subject: ‘בעל’ is holding a degree, a rank, a score or an
-- appointment, conditions alike for all; nothing gives pay or other
-- remuneration by sex.

-- not weighed against `the Severance Pay Law`: §11.ז counts the rank's
-- supplement in the wage severance is computed on. Which components count,
-- §13 sends to the regulations, which compute that wage by the collective
-- agreement that applies: a component counted adds to the severance and
-- takes nothing from it (§31 of the law).

-- not weighed against `the Advance Notice Law`: the pedagogic dismissal
-- procedure (the summary annexed, 1–9) fixes the day the employment ends —
-- the end of the school year in which the parity committee decides (8) —
-- but neither the day the committee decides nor the day the notice is sent
-- (9 names who sends it, not when). How much notice it gives turns on days
-- the text leaves open: the committee decides at its discretion after a
-- year under supervision, and a decision a month or more before the year's
-- end gives the month §3 asks after a year's work (a tenured teacher has
-- served three), one later gives less. Nothing in it takes away the
-- law's notice or the regular wage in its place (§7), which stand beside
-- it (§12). The procedure's notice as a figure is
-- `days of notice the pedagogic dismissal of 22.5.1997 gives` below.

§ `הסכם קיבוצי מיום 22.5.1997 — הנהגת דרגות קידום במכללות להכשרת עובדי הוראה`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 A fax header and a filing barcode; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 The Registrar's stamp: registered on 15.12.1997, number 434/97, and an illegible hand; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 The agreement's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The parties: the State, by the wages commissioner and the Ministry of Education's director-general ("the employers"), and הסתדרות המורים; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 Recitals: §24 of the agreement of 11.5.93 (the corpus's sic for "2.4") and §20 of that of 19.9.94 sent the colleges' promotion tracks to a joint committee, which has reached the agreement below.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The words of agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 The preamble and the annexes are part of the agreement; no rule.

-- ¶7: signed on 22/5/97 (written in by hand), in Tel Aviv.
@ref akn:preamble/p7
`the colleges' promotion-ranks agreement was signed on` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 22 5 1997

-- ¶17: the agreement is an inseparable annex to the agreements of 11.5.93
-- and 19.9.94.
@ref akn:preamble/p17
`the agreements the colleges' promotion-ranks agreement is an annex of` MEANS
    LIST DATE_FROM_DMY 11 5 1993, DATE_FROM_DMY 19 9 1994

§§ `1 הקדמה`

-- akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1/p2 A recital of the academisation of the colleges and the parties' intent to complete it by promotion ranks; no rule.
-- akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_c akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_e Guiding principles (a permanent staff, the purpose of the ranks, the colleges' own character, fitting rank and standing); no rule.

@desc A teacher-training college, as far as the agreement of 22.5.1997 asks.
DECLARE `college of 22.5.1997` HAS
    `recognised as an institution of higher education` IS A BOOLEAN @desc or holding the Council for Higher Education's permit, for the track
    `its main purpose is to train teaching employees` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its permit was cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its criteria were approved by the academic professional committee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 14.יא

-- 1.א: an academic college of education is an institution, or part of one,
-- recognised as an institution of higher education whose main purpose is
-- to train teaching employees.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN c IS A `college of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an academic college of education under 22.5.1997` c IF
        c's `recognised as an institution of higher education`
    AND c's `its main purpose is to train teaching employees`

§§ `2 תחולת ההסכם`

@desc A teaching employee at a teacher-training college, as far as the agreement of 22.5.1997 asks.
DECLARE `college teacher of 22.5.1997` HAS
    `teaches at a college with the Council's permit` IS A BOOLEAN
    `on the teaching employees' scale, under their agreements` IS A BOOLEAN
    `tenured at the college` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a second or third degree` IS A BOOLEAN
    `holds a salary grade equivalent to a second or third degree` IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 16
    `held a recognised academic appointment at an institution of higher education` IS A BOOLEAN @desc section 15
    `fixed position at the college` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 = a full position, as set for tenure under the collective agreements (4.ד)
    `fixed position in the academic tracks` IS A NUMBER
    `rank now` IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
    `years worked at the college` IS A NUMBER @desc including the years of trial for tenure (8.א)
    `years in the rank now` IS A NUMBER @desc years of full approved unpaid leave not counted (13.ג.4), a sabbatical from the study fund counted (17)
    `recommended for senior lecturer A by the college's committee` IS A BOOLEAN @desc 8.ד, 9.ג

-- 2.א–ב: it applies only to the teaching employees of the colleges with
-- the Council for Higher Education's permit who are on the teaching
-- employees' scale and under the agreements between הסתדרות המורים and the
-- State and the other public employers in education ("הסכמי עו"ה").
@ref akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the agreement of 22.5.1997 applies to` t IF
        t's `teaches at a college with the Council's permit`
    AND t's `on the teaching employees' scale, under their agreements`

DECLARE `action under the agreement of 22.5.1997` IS ONE OF
    `act to apply the agreement of 22.5.1997 to the owning bodies' teachers`
    `finish ranking the candidates for promotion by 31 May`
    `send the Ministry the candidates and the staff count by the end of April`
    `publish who is entitled to a rank a month before the year ends`
    `approve a change in the criteria or their weights`
    `consult the teacher-training division before an exceptional rank`
    `set up the committees and the criteria, of 22.5.1997`
    `notify the teachers they may apply, by 30 November`
    `confirm receipt of an application within 21 days`
    `notify the accompanying committee that the formation stage is finished`
    `decide on the criteria proposed within two months`
    `bring a pedagogic dismissal before the college's teaching committee`
    `send the warning to the parity committee by the end of July`
    `decide a pedagogic dismissal`
    `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 22.5.1997 settles`

-- 2.ג: the government acts to apply it to the teaching employees of the
-- owning bodies the Ministry of Education supervises and funds.
@ref akn:art_2__para_c
`applying the agreement of 22.5.1997 to the owning bodies` MEANS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `act to apply the agreement of 22.5.1997 to the owning bodies' teachers`

§§ `3 דרגות קידום`

-- akn:art_3/p1 The parties adopt the principle of promotion ranks under the conditions below; no rule beyond them.
-- akn:art_3__para_a/p7 Wherever a rank is named in carrying the agreement out, it is named in full; no rule to encode.
-- akn:art_3__para_c/p2 A fax header; no rule.

-- 3.א: besides the basic rank, four promotion ranks.
@ref akn:art_3__para_a akn:art_3__para_a/p2 akn:art_3__para_a/p3 akn:art_3__para_a/p4 akn:art_3__para_a/p5 akn:art_3__para_a/p6
DECLARE `rank of 22.5.1997` IS ONE OF
    `teacher, the basic rank of 22.5.1997`
    `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`
    `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`
    `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`
    `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training`

`the promotion ranks of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    LIST `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`,
         `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`,
         `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`,
         `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training`

-- ¶2 of §3: the ranks express the Council's academic recognition, and are
-- given only in institutions or tracks with its permit or recognition.
@ref akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN c IS A `college of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a college may give ranks of 22.5.1997` c IF
        c's `recognised as an institution of higher education`
    AND NOT c's `its permit was cancelled`
    AND c's `its criteria were approved by the academic professional committee`

-- 3.ב: the basic rank, "מורה", is every teaching employee teaching at a
-- college, on the terms he had on the signing, as the teachers' agreements
-- update them. 3.ג: the rest are the academic promotion ranks, given as
-- this agreement says.
@ref akn:art_3__para_b akn:art_3__para_c
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a rank of 22.5.1997 is a promotion rank` r IF
    NOT r EQUALS `teacher, the basic rank of 22.5.1997`

-- The rank below each promotion rank (§8 and 8.ו: one rank at a time).
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A `rank of 22.5.1997`
DECIDE `the rank below, of 22.5.1997` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`
    WHEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`
    WHEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`
    OTHERWISE `teacher, the basic rank of 22.5.1997`

§§ `4 זכאות לקבלת דרגת קידום`

-- akn:art_4/p1 The scale is to found a permanent academic staff, so only the teachers below may be promoted; the conditions follow.
-- akn:art_4__para_g/p2 The application procedure is in annex ב'; encoded there.
-- akn:art_4__para_g/p3 A fax header; no rule.

-- 4.א: a tenured teacher with a second or third degree (one with an
-- equivalent salary grade has his rank by §16). 4.ב: for senior teacher, lecturer and senior
-- lecturer, a fixed position at that college of 75% or more, 50% of it in
-- the academic tracks; 4.ג: for senior lecturer A, 100% or more, 75% in the
-- academic tracks. 4.ד: the tenured position is set as the collective
-- agreements set it (an input). 4.ה: one scale for the second and the
-- third degree.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_b akn:art_4__para_b/p2 akn:art_4__para_b/p3 akn:art_4__para_b/p4 akn:art_4__para_b/p5 akn:art_4__para_c akn:art_4__para_c/p2 akn:art_4__para_c/p3 akn:art_4__para_d akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the fixed position §4 asks for a rank of 22.5.1997` r IS
    IF r EQUALS `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 1 ELSE 0.75

GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the academic position §4 asks for a rank of 22.5.1997` r IS
    IF r EQUALS `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 0.75 ELSE 0.5

GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`, r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `meets §4 of 22.5.1997 for the rank` t r IF
        t's `tenured at the college`
    AND t's `holds a second or third degree`
    AND t's `fixed position at the college` AT LEAST `the fixed position §4 asks for a rank of 22.5.1997` r
    AND t's `fixed position in the academic tracks` AT LEAST `the academic position §4 asks for a rank of 22.5.1997` r

-- 4.ה.1: a tenured teacher with a third degree and experience teaching in
-- the education system is preferred for senior lecturer and senior
-- lecturer A, if he meets the conditions, where the weighing of all the
-- criteria put him level with a teacher with a second degree. 4.ה.2: that
-- experience includes kindergartens, primary, middle and post-primary
-- schools, and teaching at a college or seminary for teaching employees,
-- recognised as academic or not.
@ref akn:art_4__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_4__para_e__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_4__para_e__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_4__para_e__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_4__para_e__subpara_1/p5 akn:art_4__para_e__subpara_2
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
      `a third degree and experience in the education system` IS A BOOLEAN
      `level on the weighted criteria with one with a second degree` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `preferred for the rank under 4.ה.1 of 22.5.1997` r `a third degree and experience in the education system` `level on the weighted criteria with one with a second degree` IF
        (   r EQUALS `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`
         OR r EQUALS `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training`)
    AND `a third degree and experience in the education system`
    AND `level on the weighted criteria with one with a second degree`

-- 4.ו: a teacher who meets this section's conditions is a "candidate for
-- promotion", one who already holds a rank among them; 4.ז: only he may
-- apply. The lowest of §4's bars is the one 4.ב sets.
@ref akn:art_4__para_f akn:art_4__para_f/p2 akn:art_4__para_g
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a candidate for promotion under 22.5.1997` t IF
    `meets §4 of 22.5.1997 for the rank` t `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`

§§ `5 קריטריונים ונהלי עבודה לדרגות קידום`

-- 5.א: the appointments committees (§§9–10) give each candidate a weighted
-- score over four criteria: excellence in teaching, initiatives,
-- developing learning materials and publications; each weighs 20%, but the
-- one the table stars for the rank weighs 40%; for senior teacher,
-- teaching excellence weighs 50% and publications 10%.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a akn:art_5__para_a/p2 akn:art_5__para_a/p3 akn:art_5__para_a/t1
DECLARE `criterion of 22.5.1997` IS ONE OF
    `excellence in teaching, of 22.5.1997`
    `initiatives, of 22.5.1997`
    `developing learning materials, of 22.5.1997`
    `publications, of 22.5.1997`

`the criteria of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    LIST `excellence in teaching, of 22.5.1997`, `initiatives, of 22.5.1997`,
         `developing learning materials, of 22.5.1997`, `publications, of 22.5.1997`

GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A `criterion of 22.5.1997`
DECIDE `the criterion the table stars for` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `initiatives, of 22.5.1997`
    WHEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `developing learning materials, of 22.5.1997`
    WHEN `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `publications, of 22.5.1997`
    OTHERWISE `excellence in teaching, of 22.5.1997`

GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`, c IS A `criterion of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weight of a criterion of 22.5.1997` r c IS
    IF r EQUALS `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training` AND c EQUALS `excellence in teaching, of 22.5.1997`
    THEN 50%
    ELSE IF r EQUALS `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training` AND c EQUALS `publications, of 22.5.1997`
         THEN 10%
         ELSE IF r EQUALS `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`
              THEN 20%
              ELSE IF c EQUALS `the criterion the table stars for` r
                   THEN 40%
                   ELSE 20%

GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the weights of 22.5.1997 add up, for` r IS
    sum (map (GIVEN c YIELD `the weight of a criterion of 22.5.1997` r c) `the criteria of 22.5.1997`)

-- ¶4 of 5.א: each rank has a threshold score, and the criteria are
-- approved by the academic professional committee (§14.ט); 5.ב: the
-- committees record each criterion's score, the final weighted score and
-- the rank sought; the scores and the threshold are the committees'.
@ref akn:art_5__para_a/p4 akn:art_5__para_b
GIVEN `weighted score` IS A NUMBER, `the rank's threshold score` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `passes the rank's threshold, of 22.5.1997` `weighted score` `the rank's threshold score` IF
    `weighted score` AT LEAST `the rank's threshold score`

-- 5.ג: by 31 May each year the committee finishes the applications and
-- ranks every candidate by score, the highest first; no two share a
-- place: on a tie it decides again by further tests (position, experience,
-- seniority …), keeping the balance between the groups of teachers (6.ה,
-- the corpus's sic for "6.ג"). 5.ד: applications by 1 December. 5.ה: at
-- the end of April, a month before the names are published, the list, its
-- number and the staff count go to the teacher-training division, to check
-- §6 is not exceeded and to budget. 5.ו: the names and their ranks are
-- published a month before the school year ends at the latest; the scores
-- and the order stay confidential.
@ref akn:art_5__para_c
`ranking the candidates of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the college's appointments committee`
    MUST  `finish ranking the candidates for promotion by 31 May`

@ref akn:art_5__para_d
`the last day to apply for a rank of 22.5.1997, in a year` MEANS "1 December"

@ref akn:art_5__para_e
`sending the candidates to the Ministry, of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the college's appointments committee`
    MUST  `send the Ministry the candidates and the staff count by the end of April`

@ref akn:art_5__para_f akn:art_5__para_f/p2
`publishing the ranks of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the college's appointments committee`
    MUST  `publish who is entitled to a rank a month before the year ends`

-- 5.ז: a change in the criteria or the weights, or a new criterion, only
-- through the accompanying committee and with its approval.
@ref akn:art_5__para_g
`changing the criteria of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the colleges' accompanying committee`
    MAY   `approve a change in the criteria or their weights`

§§ `6 קביעת דרגות הקידום`

-- 6.א: the ranks express the candidates' excellence on the criteria and
-- the committee's score; of all the candidates for promotion, those with
-- the highest scores who pass the rank's threshold may hold it: senior
-- teacher up to 35%, lecturer up to 25%, senior lecturer up to 15%, senior
-- lecturer A up to 5%; the rest, at least 20%, stay in the basic rank.
@ref akn:art_6__para_a akn:art_6__para_a/p2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_4/p2 akn:art_6__para_a__subpara_5
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may hold` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 35%
    WHEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 25%
    WHEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 15%
    WHEN `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 5%
    OTHERWISE 100%

`the fewest of the candidates in the basic rank, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 20%

-- 6.ב: the candidates are every teacher at the institution who meets §4,
-- with a rank or without. 6.ג: the shares are kept in every institution
-- every year, with no excess; the Ministry computes them from November's
-- staff count, on the data each college sends in time. 6.ד: a holder of a
-- rank on full approved unpaid leave counts as one.
@ref akn:art_6__para_b akn:art_6__para_c akn:art_6__para_d
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
      `candidates for promotion in November` IS A NUMBER @desc with or without a rank (6.ב)
      `holders of the rank, those on full approved unpaid leave among them` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the college keeps the share of the rank, of 22.5.1997` r `candidates for promotion in November` `holders of the rank, those on full approved unpaid leave among them` IF
    `holders of the rank, those on full approved unpaid leave among them`
        AT MOST `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may hold` r TIMES `candidates for promotion in November`

-- 6.ה: within 6.א, a fitting balance is kept in every rank between the
-- four groups of teachers.
@ref akn:art_6__para_e akn:art_6__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_6__para_e__subpara_2 akn:art_6__para_e__subpara_3 akn:art_6__para_e__subpara_4
DECLARE `group of teachers of 22.5.1997` IS ONE OF
    `the sciences of education, of 22.5.1997`
    `pedagogic guidance, of 22.5.1997`
    `the social sciences and humanities, of 22.5.1997`
    `the life sciences or the exact sciences, of 22.5.1997`

§§ `7 קביעת דרגות קידום – חריגים`

-- §7: despite §4 and within §6, the college's committee may give ranks to
-- a few teachers with a fixed position under 75%: 7.א up to 10% of the
-- candidates, within §6's shares; 7.ב never senior lecturer A; 7.ג senior
-- lecturer only at 66% or more, 50% of it academic; 7.ד senior teacher and
-- lecturer only at 50% or more in the academic tracks. 7.ה: not in the
-- formation stage, but 7.ו: then too for teachers in a unique field whose
-- hours at the institution do not allow §4's position. 7.ז: before such a
-- rank, the teacher-training division is consulted that 7.א is kept.
@ref akn:art_7/p1 akn:art_7__para_a akn:art_7__para_b akn:art_7__para_c akn:art_7__para_c/p2 akn:art_7__para_c/p3 akn:art_7__para_d akn:art_7__para_d/p2 akn:art_7__para_d/p3 akn:art_7__para_d/p4 akn:art_7__para_e akn:art_7__para_f
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`, r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
      `in the formation stage` IS A BOOLEAN
      `in a unique field whose hours do not allow §4's position` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may hold the rank by the exception of §7 of 22.5.1997` t r `in the formation stage` `in a unique field whose hours do not allow §4's position` IF
        t's `tenured at the college`
    AND (t's `holds a second or third degree` OR t's `holds a salary grade equivalent to a second or third degree`)
    AND ((NOT `in the formation stage`) OR `in a unique field whose hours do not allow §4's position`)
    AND (   (    r EQUALS `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`
             AND t's `fixed position at the college` AT LEAST 0.66
             AND t's `fixed position in the academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5)
         OR (    (   r EQUALS `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`
                  OR r EQUALS `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training`)
             AND t's `fixed position in the academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5))

`the most of the candidates §7 of 22.5.1997 may promote` MEANS 10%

@ref akn:art_7__para_g
`consulting the division before an exceptional rank, of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the college's appointments committee`
    MUST  `consult the teacher-training division before an exceptional rank`

§§ `8 קידום בסולם הדרגות – שהייה בדרגה`

-- §8: a candidate applies to the college's committee: 8.א senior teacher
-- after 4 years at that institution, the years of trial for tenure among
-- them; 8.ב lecturer after 3 years as senior teacher; 8.ג senior lecturer
-- after 3 as lecturer; 8.ד senior lecturer A after 4 as senior lecturer,
-- and only if the college's committee recommended him and the
-- inter-college committee decided to appoint him. 8.ו: one rank above his
-- own at a time.
@ref akn:art_8/p1 akn:art_8__para_a akn:art_8__para_b akn:art_8__para_c akn:art_8__para_d akn:art_8__para_f
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the years §8 of 22.5.1997 asks before the rank` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 3
    WHEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 3
    OTHERWISE 4

GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`, r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may apply for the rank under §8 of 22.5.1997` t r IF
        `a rank of 22.5.1997 is a promotion rank` r
    AND t's `rank now` EQUALS `the rank below, of 22.5.1997` r
    AND (IF r EQUALS `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training`
         THEN t's `years worked at the college` AT LEAST `the years §8 of 22.5.1997 asks before the rank` r
         ELSE t's `years in the rank now` AT LEAST `the years §8 of 22.5.1997 asks before the rank` r)
    AND (    NOT r EQUALS `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training`
         OR t's `recommended for senior lecturer A by the college's committee`)

-- 8.ה: a rank is held only at the institution that gave it, and promotion
-- is only there; a teacher who moves does not carry it, but may earn a rank
-- at the other institution by its committee.
@ref akn:art_8__para_e akn:art_8__para_e/p2
GIVEN `moved to another institution` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `keeps the rank of 22.5.1997 at the new institution` `moved to another institution` IF
    NOT `moved to another institution`

-- akn:art_8__para_f/p2 A fax header; no rule.

§§ `9 ועדת מינויים מוסדית לדרגות קידום`

-- 9.א: in every college, a standing appointments committee of 6, its
-- members of academic seniority as the accompanying committee sets. 9.ב:
-- it scores the candidates by the rules and the criteria, once the
-- academic professional committee approved them. 9.ג: it gives every rank
-- but senior lecturer A, which it recommends to the inter-college
-- committee. 9.ד: its members are 3 of the college's management (the
-- director, the head of guidance, the head of academic studies, or their
-- deputies) and 4 elected from the teachers by field — the sciences of
-- education, pedagogic guidance, and two more by the college's fields,
-- which the director passes to the election committee — of whom 3 always
-- sit. 9.ד.3: at a meeting, at most 3 of the management and 3 teachers:
-- education and guidance always, the third from the candidate's field (or,
-- for a candidate in education or guidance, from another). 9.ד.4: by
-- majority; 9.ד.5: the accompanying committee sets up a pool of 10
-- academics from outside the colleges, one of whom, in turn, casts the
-- deciding vote, never from the same college. 9.ה: the director chairs.
-- 9.ו: the elected members by personal, secret ballot every 3 years.
@ref akn:art_9__para_a akn:art_9__para_b akn:art_9__para_c akn:art_9__para_c/p2 akn:art_9__para_d akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p4 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p5 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p6 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p7 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p8 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_2/p9 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_3 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_4 akn:art_9__para_d__subpara_5 akn:art_9__para_e akn:art_9__para_f
`the members of the college's appointments committee, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 6
`of the management, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 3
`elected from the teachers, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 4
`of the elected who sit, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 3
`the outside pool of the accompanying committee, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 10
`years between elections to the appointments committee, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 3

GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the college's committee gives the rank, of 22.5.1997` r IF
        `a rank of 22.5.1997 is a promotion rank` r
    AND NOT r EQUALS `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training`

-- 9.ז: who may vote: the tenured teachers with a second or third degree
-- employed in a fixed position of 50% or more in the academic tracks.
-- 9.ח: who may be elected: the tenured teachers with a second or third
-- degree in a fixed position of 75% or more, 50% of it academic.
@ref akn:art_9__para_g
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may vote for the appointments committee, of 22.5.1997` t IF
        t's `tenured at the college`
    AND t's `holds a second or third degree`
    AND t's `fixed position in the academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5

@ref akn:art_9__para_h
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be elected to the appointments committee, of 22.5.1997` t IF
        t's `tenured at the college`
    AND t's `holds a second or third degree`
    AND t's `fixed position at the college` AT LEAST 0.75
    AND t's `fixed position in the academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5

-- 9.ט: every elected member has one deputy, who stands in only in an
-- emergency (illness, reserve duty, maternity leave and the like): the
-- candidate of the same field with the most votes after him. 9.י: the
-- procedure is annex ב'. 9.יא: a meeting decides only with 5 members, one
-- of them from the candidate's field.
@ref akn:art_9__para_i akn:art_9__para_i/p2 akn:art_9__para_i/p3 akn:art_9__para_j akn:art_9__para_ja
GIVEN `members present` IS A NUMBER, `one of them from the candidate's field` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the college's committee may decide, of 22.5.1997` `members present` `one of them from the candidate's field` IF
    `members present` AT LEAST 5 AND `one of them from the candidate's field`

-- 9.יב: a member of the college's committee applies for a rank to an ad hoc
-- committee of 5: a chair from the pool (9.ד.5, the corpus's sic for
-- "9.ד.4"), 2 of management and 2 teachers — one of each from the
-- candidate's college and one from another's; the candidate does not sit;
-- the division asks each college for its outside members and places them.
-- 9.יג: a college's director applies to the inter-college committee.
@ref akn:art_9__para_jb akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_1 akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_1/p2 akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_1/p3 akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_1/p4 akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_2 akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_3 akn:art_9__para_jb__subpara_4 akn:art_9__para_jc
`the members of an ad hoc appointments committee, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 1 PLUS 2 PLUS 2

§§ `10 ועדת מינויים בין מכללתית`

-- 10.א: the accompanying committee sets up a standing inter-college
-- committee of 7, all senior lecturer A (one may be senior lecturer);
-- 10.ב: it decides senior lecturer A, on the same rules and criteria, once
-- the college's committee recommended the candidate; 10.ג: in the
-- formation stage its members are senior lecturer at least; 10.ד: how it is
-- appointed the accompanying committee sets a year after the signing.
-- 10.ה: its chair, an academic agreed by the parties on the Ministry's
-- recommendation; 3 professionals from the fields (9.ד.2, the corpus's sic
-- for "10.ד.2") on an agreed list, two standing and one chosen per meeting
-- by the candidate's field; 3 from the candidate's college's committee —
-- one of management, one elected, one elected from the candidate's field;
-- appointed every 3 years, each with a deputy from the same college.
-- 10.ו: it decides only with 5 present, the elected member from the
-- candidate's field among them.
@ref akn:art_10__para_a akn:art_10__para_a/p2 akn:art_10__para_b akn:art_10__para_c akn:art_10__para_d akn:art_10__para_e akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_1 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_2 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_2/p4 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_3 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_3/p3 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_3/p4 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_3/p5 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_4 akn:art_10__para_e__subpara_5 akn:art_10__para_f
`the members of the inter-college committee, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 7

`the inter-college committee as 10.ה composes it, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 1 PLUS 3 PLUS 3

GIVEN `members present` IS A NUMBER, `the elected member from the candidate's field among them` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the inter-college committee may decide, of 22.5.1997` `members present` `the elected member from the candidate's field among them` IF
    `members present` AT LEAST 5 AND `the elected member from the candidate's field among them`

-- akn:art_10__para_d/p2 A fax header; no rule.

§§ `11 תגמול רמות קידום`

-- ¶1: "combined salary" is the one the teacher is entitled to by his
-- personal data in the teachers' salary tables. 11.א–ד: a supplement of
-- 5%, 7.5%, 10% and 15% of it for senior teacher, lecturer, senior
-- lecturer and senior lecturer A. 11.ה: a later wage agreement may change
-- them. 11.ו: paid in proportion to the position he actually holds at the
-- institution that school year, and above a full position too.
@ref akn:art_11/p1 akn:art_11/p2 akn:art_11__para_a akn:art_11__para_b akn:art_11__para_c akn:art_11__para_d akn:art_11__para_e
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the supplement rate of a rank of 22.5.1997` r IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 5%
    WHEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 7.5%
    WHEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN (10%)
    WHEN `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN 15%
    OTHERWISE 0

@ref akn:art_11__para_f
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
      `combined salary` IS A NUMBER
      `position actually held at the institution that year` IS A NUMBER @desc 1 = a full position; above 1 counted too
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the rank's supplement of 22.5.1997` r `combined salary` `position actually held at the institution that year` IS
    `the supplement rate of a rank of 22.5.1997` r TIMES `combined salary` TIMES `position actually held at the institution that year`

-- 11.ז: the supplement is salary for the hour value, social contributions
-- and severance. 11.ח: for one insured in an accruing pension, a component
-- for contributions from the day of the rank, paid into the fund by its
-- rules.
DECLARE `what the rank's supplement of 22.5.1997 might count for` IS ONE OF
    `the hour value, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`
    `social contributions, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`
    `severance pay, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`
    `accruing-pension contributions, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`
    `the budgetary pension, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`

@ref akn:art_11__para_g akn:art_11__para_h
GIVEN p IS A `what the rank's supplement of 22.5.1997 might count for`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rank's supplement of 22.5.1997 counts for` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `the budgetary pension, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`

-- 11.ט: for one insured in a budgetary pension, the supplement of his last
-- year counts toward the pension if he was entitled to a rank's supplement
-- in the 4 years before he retired; ¶2: so 3 years in one or more ranks
-- and a further rank in the last year count the last supplement, though
-- he held it one year. 11.י: in the formation stage, one who held a rank 3
-- years and retired in the stage has it counted on 3 years alone.
@ref akn:art_11__para_i akn:art_11__para_i/p2 akn:art_11__para_j
GIVEN `years with a rank's supplement before retiring` IS A NUMBER
      `retired in the formation stage` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the last supplement counts toward the budgetary pension, of 22.5.1997` `years with a rank's supplement before retiring` `retired in the formation stage` IF
    `years with a rank's supplement before retiring` AT LEAST (IF `retired in the formation stage` THEN 3 ELSE 4)

#ASSERT `the last supplement counts toward the budgetary pension, of 22.5.1997` (3 PLUS 1) FALSE

§§ `12 מועד קבלת הדרגה`

-- 12.א: the committees work from 1 November to 31 May each year. 12.ב: the
-- rank and its supplement run from 1 January of that school year (14.כ:
-- in the formation stage's first year, from 1.9.97).
@ref akn:art_12__para_a
`the committees of 22.5.1997 begin their year on` MEANS "1 November"

@ref akn:art_12__para_b
GIVEN `the year the school year begins` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
DECIDE `a rank of 22.5.1997 runs from` `the year the school year begins` IS
    IF `the year the school year begins` EQUALS 1997
    THEN DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 1997
    ELSE DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 (`the year the school year begins` PLUS 1)

§§ `13 ביטול דרגת הקידום`

-- §13: a rank is cancelled 13.א when the teacher leaves the college for
-- another institution; 13.ב when his fixed position, or his fixed position
-- in the academic tracks, no longer meets §4; 13.ד when the college's
-- permit is cancelled, from that day. 13.ג: not for full approved unpaid
-- leave, up to two years; ¶3: the supplement goes with the rank.
@ref akn:art_13/p1 akn:art_13__para_a akn:art_13__para_b akn:art_13__para_c akn:art_13__para_d akn:art_13/p2
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`
      `left for another institution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the college's permit was cancelled` IS A BOOLEAN
      `years on full approved unpaid leave now` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rank of 22.5.1997 is cancelled` t `left for another institution` `the college's permit was cancelled` `years on full approved unpaid leave now` IF
       `left for another institution`
    OR `the college's permit was cancelled`
    OR `years on full approved unpaid leave now` GREATER THAN 2
    OR (    `years on full approved unpaid leave now` EQUALS 0
        AND NOT `meets §4 of 22.5.1997 for the rank` t (t's `rank now`))

-- 13.ג.1: back from full approved unpaid leave within two years, he counts
-- as a rank's holder under §6 and is paid under §11. 13.ג.2: during it no
-- supplement, but for a sabbatical year from the study fund. 13.ג.3: on
-- partial approved unpaid leave, the supplement by the part he works.
@ref akn:art_13__para_c__subpara_1 akn:art_13__para_c__subpara_2 akn:art_13__para_c__subpara_3
DECLARE `a teacher's year under the agreement of 22.5.1997` IS ONE OF
    `a year of work, of 22.5.1997`
    `a year of full approved unpaid leave, of 22.5.1997`
    `a sabbatical year from the study fund, of 22.5.1997`
    `a year of the birth and parenthood period, of 22.5.1997`

GIVEN y IS A `a teacher's year under the agreement of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rank's supplement of 22.5.1997 is paid for` y IF
    NOT y EQUALS `a year of full approved unpaid leave, of 22.5.1997`

-- 13.ג.4: the years of full unpaid leave earn no seniority in a rank (§8),
-- neither for promotion nor for accruing a pension "under 11.ז", but for
-- a sabbatical from the study fund. F-michlalot-1997-a: §11.ז is the hour
-- value, social contributions and severance; the pension's years are
-- §11.ט's. The reading adopted is §11.ט (convention
-- reading.cross-reference-subject, a pick for the lawyer, MMS-623). §17: a
-- sabbatical year is a year of work for every purpose of the agreement.
@ref akn:art_13__para_c__subpara_4 akn:art_17/p1
GIVEN y IS A `a teacher's year under the agreement of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the year counts as time in a rank of 22.5.1997` y IF
    NOT y EQUALS `a year of full approved unpaid leave, of 22.5.1997`

`the clause §13.ג.4 of 22.5.1997 cites for the pension is printed` MEANS "11.ז"
`the clause §13.ג.4 of 22.5.1997 cites for the pension is read as` MEANS "11.ט"
`what §11.ז of 22.5.1997 counts the supplement for` MEANS
    LIST `the hour value, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`, `social contributions, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`, `severance pay, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997`

`§13.ג.4 of 22.5.1997 cites for the pension a clause that is not on the pension` MEANS
        NOT `the clause §13.ג.4 of 22.5.1997 cites for the pension is printed` EQUALS `the clause §13.ג.4 of 22.5.1997 cites for the pension is read as`
    AND NOT elem `the budgetary pension, rank's supplement of 22.5.1997` `what §11.ז of 22.5.1997 counts the supplement for`
#ASSERT `§13.ג.4 of 22.5.1997 cites for the pension a clause that is not on the pension`

-- The Women's Work Law (imported): the birth and parenthood period is no
-- unpaid leave, so it counts as time in a rank and the supplement is due
-- for it (the period's pay is the National Insurance's), as the law keeps
-- a right that turns on seniority; the unpaid absence after it (§7(ד)), if
-- taken as full approved unpaid leave, counts for neither, as the law
-- counts it for no seniority. The floor is met.
`§13.ג of 22.5.1997 counts the birth and parenthood period, as the Women's Work Law keeps it` MEANS
        `the year counts as time in a rank of 22.5.1997` `a year of the birth and parenthood period, of 22.5.1997`
    AND `the birth and parenthood period harms no right that turns on seniority`
    AND NOT `the year counts as time in a rank of 22.5.1997` `a year of full approved unpaid leave, of 22.5.1997`
    AND NOT `the absence after the period under section 7(ד) counts for seniority`
#ASSERT `§13.ג of 22.5.1997 counts the birth and parenthood period, as the Women's Work Law keeps it`

-- akn:art_13/p3 A fax header; no rule.

§§ `14 שלב העיצוב`

-- 14.א: the formation stage, the first stage of carrying the agreement out,
-- runs from the start of the college's committee's deliberations for at
-- least two years and at most three: senior teacher and lecturer filled in
-- up to two years, senior lecturer up to three, senior lecturer A at least
-- three, and in exceptional cases four.
@ref akn:art_14__para_a akn:art_14__para_a/p2 akn:art_14__para_a/p3 akn:art_14__para_a/p4
`the fewest years of the formation stage, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 2
`the most years of the formation stage, of 22.5.1997` MEANS 3

-- 14.ב: from the signing, no less than 3 and no more than 6 months for the
-- colleges to set up the committees (§9), set the criteria (§5) and
-- prepare; the committees start within 6 months of the signing.
@ref akn:art_14__para_b
`setting up the colleges' committees, of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `set up the committees and the criteria, of 22.5.1997`
    WITHIN 183

-- 14.ג: an institution that finished the stage tells the accompanying
-- committee in writing, which may approve passing to the permanent
-- procedure, by the agreement and its own directions, by the academic
-- seniority built at the institution.
@ref akn:art_14__para_c akn:art_14__para_c/p2
`notifying the end of the formation stage, of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `notify the accompanying committee that the formation stage is finished`

-- 14.ד: in the stage, of §6's shares each year at most half of senior
-- teacher's and lecturer's, a third of senior lecturer's, and a third of
-- senior lecturer A's from the stage's second year. 14.ה: the committees
-- may end the stage without using them, with the accompanying committee's
-- approval.
@ref akn:art_14__para_d akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_3 akn:art_14__para_d__subpara_4 akn:art_14__para_e
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`, `the year of the formation stage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may take in a year of the formation stage` r `the year of the formation stage` IS
    CONSIDER r
    WHEN `senior teacher in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may hold` r DIVIDED BY 2
    WHEN `lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may hold` r DIVIDED BY 2
    WHEN `senior lecturer in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may hold` r DIVIDED BY 3
    WHEN `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training` THEN
        IF `the year of the formation stage` AT LEAST 2 THEN `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may hold` r DIVIDED BY 3 ELSE 0
    OTHERWISE 0

-- 14.ו: when the stage ends a teacher applies under the rest of the
-- agreement, §9 above all; ¶3: in the stage, and only then, the
-- arrangement below.
@ref akn:art_14__para_f akn:art_14__hc_1
GIVEN `in the formation stage` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a teacher applies by 14.ז–כג of 22.5.1997` `in the formation stage` IF
    `in the formation stage`

-- akn:art_14__para_f/p2 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_1 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_4 The headings of the formation stage's four steps; the rules are their clauses.

-- 14.ז: in the stage the college's committee is composed as §9 says, with
-- no duty on its members to hold a rank, but one elected member or deputy
-- holds a third degree, and so do the management's members (one may hold a
-- second); its members meet §4; the elections are in annex ב'. 14.ח: in
-- the stage only, two deputies where 40 or more teachers are candidates.
@ref akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_1__para_g akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_1__para_g/p2 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_1__para_g/p3 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_1__para_h
GIVEN `candidates for promotion at the college` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `deputies for each elected member in the formation stage, of 22.5.1997` `candidates for promotion at the college` IS
    IF `candidates for promotion at the college` AT LEAST 40 THEN 2 ELSE 1

-- akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_1__para_h/p2 A fax header; no rule.

-- 14.ט: each college's committee proposes the criteria in detail, with
-- the scores and the thresholds, to the academic professional committee
-- the accompanying committee appoints. 14.י: the scores rest on
-- quantitative, objective tests: the superiors' opinion, the staff's
-- recommendations, the students' questionnaires, the publications. 14.יא:
-- that committee approves the proposal or returns it with directions; an
-- institution not approved gives no ranks. 14.יב: it decides within two
-- months. 14.יג: it may propose a weighted expression of the criteria with
-- a threshold, for the committees to use. 14.יד: once approved, the
-- institution publishes the criteria to its teachers, who may then apply.
@ref akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_i akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_j akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_j__subpara_1 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_j__subpara_2 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_j__subpara_3 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_j__subpara_4 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_ja akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_ja__subpara_1 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_ja__subpara_2 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_ja/p2 akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_jb akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_jc akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_jd
`deciding the criteria proposed, of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the colleges' accompanying committee`
    MUST  `decide on the criteria proposed within two months`
    WITHIN 61

-- akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_2__para_jd/p2 A fax header; no rule.

-- 14.טו–כא: in the stage, the candidates apply without naming the rank, by
-- a day the committee sets within 6 months of the signing; it scores the
-- best for each rank within 14.א, records the scores, ranks everyone by 31
-- May keeping the balance (6.ה, the corpus's sic for "6ג"), and before
-- publishing sends the Ministry its list, its number and the staff count,
-- to check there is no excess "under ס"ק א" and to budget; a list in excess
-- "of סעיף קטן א'" goes back. F-michlalot-1997-c: ס"ק א of §14 is the
-- stage's timetable; the shares are §6.א's (and in the stage §14.ד's). The
-- reading adopted is §6.א, as §5.ה reads "שאין חריגה ע"פ סעיף 6" (convention
-- reading.cross-reference-subject, a pick for the lawyer, MMS-623). The
-- first year ends on 31.5.98, the ranks from 1.9.97; it publishes by the
-- end of June; the ranks run from 1 January.
@ref akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_if akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_ig akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_jg akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_jh akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_ji akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_k akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_ka akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_3__para_ka/p2
GIVEN r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
      `the year of the formation stage` IS A NUMBER
      `candidates for promotion in November` IS A NUMBER
      `the rank's holders on the list` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the list of the formation stage goes back for an excess, of 22.5.1997` r `the year of the formation stage` `candidates for promotion in November` `the rank's holders on the list` IF
    `the rank's holders on the list` GREATER THAN
        `the most of the candidates a rank of 22.5.1997 may take in a year of the formation stage` r `the year of the formation stage` TIMES `candidates for promotion in November`

`the clause §14.יט of 22.5.1997 checks the excess against is printed` MEANS "14.א"
`the clause §14.יט of 22.5.1997 checks the excess against is read as` MEANS "6.א"
`what §14.א of 22.5.1997 sets` MEANS "the formation stage's length and timetable"

`§14.יט of 22.5.1997 checks the shares against a clause that sets none` MEANS
        NOT `the clause §14.יט of 22.5.1997 checks the excess against is printed` EQUALS `the clause §14.יט of 22.5.1997 checks the excess against is read as`
    AND `the fewest years of the formation stage, of 22.5.1997` EQUALS 2
#ASSERT `§14.יט of 22.5.1997 checks the shares against a clause that sets none`

-- 14.כב: the college's committee repeats step ג every year to the end of
-- the stage. 14.כג: from the stage's second year it may recommend a senior
-- lecturer to the inter-college committee for senior lecturer A.
@ref akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_4__para_kb akn:art_14__hc_1__hc_4__para_kc
GIVEN `the year of the formation stage` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the college's committee may recommend senior lecturer A in the formation stage, of 22.5.1997` `the year of the formation stage` IF
    `the year of the formation stage` AT LEAST 2

§§ `15 מורה חדש בעל מינוי אקדמי`

-- 15.א: a new teacher with a second or third degree who held a recognised
-- academic appointment at an institution the Council recognises, employed
-- at 50% or more in the college's academic tracks, may be appointed senior
-- teacher, lecturer or senior lecturer before he is tenured, and is paid
-- its supplement. 15.ב: such teachers without tenure at most 5% of the
-- candidates, above §6's shares. 15.ג: once tenured he is as any other;
-- his seniority in the rank runs from his first rank. 15.ד: before such a
-- rank the division is consulted that 15.ב is kept.
@ref akn:art_15__para_a akn:art_15__para_a/p2 akn:art_15__para_a/p3 akn:art_15__para_a/p4 akn:art_15__para_a/p5 akn:art_15__para_a/p6 akn:art_15__para_a/p7 akn:art_15__para_b akn:art_15__para_c akn:art_15__para_d
GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`, r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a new teacher may be appointed to the rank under §15 of 22.5.1997` t r IF
        t's `holds a second or third degree`
    AND t's `held a recognised academic appointment at an institution of higher education`
    AND t's `fixed position in the academic tracks` AT LEAST 0.5
    AND `a rank of 22.5.1997 is a promotion rank` r
    AND NOT r EQUALS `senior lecturer A in an academic institution for teacher training`

`the most of the candidates §15 of 22.5.1997 may add` MEANS 5%

-- akn:art_15__para_d/p2 A fax header; no rule.

§§ `16 דרגות שכר אקויוולנטיות`

-- §16: a teacher with a salary grade equivalent to a second or third degree
-- may apply. 16.א: his rank is set "under §7". F-michlalot-1997-b: §7 is
-- the exceptions below a 75% position; §6 sets the ranks. The reading
-- adopted is §7 as printed, which fits the sentence (convention
-- reading.cross-reference-subject, a pick for the lawyer, MMS-623).
-- 16.ב–ג: each year the share of the ranks given to the equivalent grades
-- may not exceed their share of the candidates; the limit is not on the
-- degree holders.
@ref akn:art_16/p1 akn:art_16__para_a akn:art_16__para_b akn:art_16__para_c
GIVEN `candidates with a degree` IS A NUMBER
      `candidates with an equivalent grade` IS A NUMBER
      `ranks given` IS A NUMBER
      `ranks given to an equivalent grade` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the equivalent grades keep their share, of 22.5.1997` `candidates with a degree` `candidates with an equivalent grade` `ranks given` `ranks given to an equivalent grade` IF
    `ranks given to an equivalent grade` TIMES (`candidates with a degree` PLUS `candidates with an equivalent grade`)
        AT MOST `candidates with an equivalent grade` TIMES `ranks given`

GIVEN t IS A `college teacher of 22.5.1997`, r IS A `rank of 22.5.1997`, `in the formation stage` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an equivalent grade may hold the rank under §16 of 22.5.1997` t r `in the formation stage` IF
        t's `holds a salary grade equivalent to a second or third degree`
    AND `may hold the rank by the exception of §7 of 22.5.1997` t r `in the formation stage` FALSE

`the clause §16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by is printed` MEANS "7"
`the clause §16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by is read as` MEANS "7"
`the clause that sets the ranks, of 22.5.1997` MEANS "6"

`§16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by the exceptions, not by the clause that sets them` MEANS
        `the clause §16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by is printed` EQUALS `the clause §16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by is read as`
    AND NOT `the clause §16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by is printed` EQUALS `the clause that sets the ranks, of 22.5.1997`
#ASSERT `§16.א of 22.5.1997 sets the ranks by the exceptions, not by the clause that sets them`

§§ `18 ועדת הליווי`

-- 18.א: a parity accompanying committee for interpreting and carrying out
-- this agreement only, chaired by the head of the Ministry's division for
-- training teachers: the division, the wages commissioner, the colleges'
-- directors and הסתדרות המורים (the amendment of 30.12.1997 makes the
-- directors' representative an observer). It sets up professional bodies
-- as needed.
@ref akn:art_18__para_a akn:art_18__para_a/p2 akn:art_18__para_a/p3 akn:art_18__para_a/p4 akn:art_18__para_a/p5
DECLARE `member of the accompanying committee of 22.5.1997` IS ONE OF
    `the teacher-training division's representative, of 22.5.1997`
    `the wages commissioner's representative, of 22.5.1997`
    `the colleges' directors' representative, of 22.5.1997`
    `הסתדרות המורים's representatives, of 22.5.1997`

`the accompanying committee's members as signed, of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    LIST `the teacher-training division's representative, of 22.5.1997`,
         `the wages commissioner's representative, of 22.5.1997`,
         `the colleges' directors' representative, of 22.5.1997`,
         `הסתדרות המורים's representatives, of 22.5.1997`

-- 18.ב: a dispute in it over the agreement's interpretation, carrying out
-- or application goes to the parity committee of four — the director-
-- general, the wages commissioner, the union's secretary-general, or their
-- representatives. 18.ג: if it does not decide, each side may take the
-- steps any law allows it.
@ref akn:art_18__para_b akn:art_18__para_b/p2 akn:art_18__para_b/p3 akn:art_18__para_b/p4 akn:art_18__para_c
GIVEN `the committee of four decided` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `each side may take its lawful steps, of 22.5.1997` `the committee of four decided` IF
    NOT `the committee of four decided`

§§ `19 שמירת זכויות ויישום ההסכם`

-- 19.א: the agreement takes away no right of the parties and the teaching
-- employees under earlier or later wage agreements; 19.ב: the ranks harm
-- no promotion on the teaching employees' scale. 19.ד: the disputes
-- declared over what it settles are void on the signing. 19.ה: it exhausts
-- the claims over the colleges' promotion ranks under the agreements of
-- 11.5.93 and 19.9.94. 19.ו: earlier terms not changed stand.
@ref akn:art_19__para_a akn:art_19__para_b akn:art_19__para_d akn:art_19__para_e akn:art_19__para_f
`claims over the colleges' ranks remain after 22.5.1997` MEANS FALSE
`earlier terms stand after 22.5.1997 unless changed` MEANS TRUE

-- 19.ג: no strike, lockout or organised disruption over what it settles.
@ref akn:art_19__para_c
`industrial peace of 22.5.1997` MEANS
    PARTY `the teachers' union`
    SHANT `strike, lock out or disrupt work over what the agreement of 22.5.1997 settles`

